  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CPN Bond Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main expected project-level outcomes are environmental effects via improved resource efficiency of green buildings, and stakeholder effects due to increased access to high-quality modern retail services in Thailands suburban and rural areas. IFC expects the project to catalyze sustainability in the Thai retail property sector via demonstration and replication channels, given CPNs high visibility and market leading position in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment comprises senior unsecured sustainability linked-debt by IFC, for its own account,  of up to THB4.6 billion (approximately US$125 million equivalent) through subscription to senior unsecured  Sustainability-linked Bonds (SLB) proposed, to be issued by CPN as part of public issuances in one or more</narrative>
  </description>
